# No backend or secret environment variables are required for the local-only PWA scaffold.
# Add public build-time settings here later if needed.
#
# WARNING: Anything prefixed with VITE_ is inlined into the built frontend
# JavaScript bundle at build time and must be treated as PUBLIC — anyone
# who loads the app can read it. Never place encryption keys, master
# passwords, recovery keys, API secrets, signing secrets, or any other
# credential in a VITE_* variable.
